# Batch files are run by cmd.exe, which wants CRLF, and they are only
# ever used on Windows. Everything else keeps LF whatever the checkout.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# The H.264 and AAC test vectors, and the picture and the samples a reference
# decoder made from them. A newline translated anywhere in any of these is a
# decoder bug that only appears on one platform, so none of them is ever
# text.
#
# Four files, and they are here because the packagers decode them inside a
# finished bundle -- see docs/testing.md. The rest of the media vectors moved
# to feetplayer along with the decoders, and the rules that keep them binary
# moved with them -- as did the linguist-language rule for fortran/*.inc,
# because there is no fortran/ in this repository for it to apply to now.
*.264 binary
*.i420.z binary
*.aac binary
*.f32.z binary
